{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117599","id":3417256733,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7LrzMd","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117599","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117599.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117599.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117599","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117599/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117599/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117599/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/4d902fd3aafc6aafe996970cc19968456763a6c0","number":117599,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Move method maps from `ClassDB` to `GDType`.","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"- Follow-up of #113586 \r\n- Follow-up of https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117474\r\n- Works towards https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/12323\r\n\r\nMoves `MethodBind` maps from `ClassDB` to `GDType`, to make access more efficient and to consolidate typing.\r\n\r\nThis one is not as trivial as https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117474 (some decisions which I'm commenting below), but also not nearly as complicated as #113586. Overall, it should be relatively painless with targeted reviews :)\r\n\r\n### Notes\r\n\r\nOne thing of note is that a few classes currently accidentally bind the methods of supertypes (to the supertypes). For example:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/456bdea954ee24e48cb562bfbf531de1cd96e371/scene/resources/mesh.cpp#L2318\r\n\r\nCan be seen in the docs under `Mesh` instead of `ArrayMesh`:\r\n\r\n[docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/classes/class_mesh.html#class-mesh-method-create-trimesh-shape](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/classes/class_mesh.html#class-mesh-method-create-trimesh-shape)\r\n\r\nThis doesn't work anymore with the new approach, because `GDType` is finalized after `_bind_methods`.\r\nTo fix the specific issues, I decided to do the agnostic thing and move the bindings to where they're bound anyway (a practical no-op), with a comment for follow-ups to decide how to address it properly.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","description":"","color":"447777","default":false,"a